# ============================================================================
# DEV-ONLY RSA-3072 PUBLIC KEY — pre-encrypted OTA packaging (release side).
#
# This is the PUBLIC half of the dev keypair. The DEVICE never uses this file;
# it is kept in the repo so the release engineer can PACKAGE/encrypt an OTA
# image with it, e.g.:
#
#   python managed_components/espressif__esp_encrypted_img/tools/esp_enc_img_gen.py \
#       encrypt build/modulo_wifi.bin main/ota_decrypt_pub.pem build/modulo_wifi_enc.bin
#
# The matching PRIVATE key the device decrypts with lives in
# main/ota_decrypt_priv.pem (gitignored, secret). This public key is paired with
# the DEV private key only — regenerate both before production.
# ============================================================================
